msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p>This shows all the people in the channel.  The nick for each person is shown.<br />"
"Usually an icon is shown showing the status of each person, but you do not seem to have any icon theme installed.  See the Konversation settings - <i>Configure Konversation</i> under the <i>Settings</i> menu.  Then view the page for <i>Themes</i> under <i>Appearance</i>.</p>"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Dit wiest all Lüü binnen den Klöönruum un ehr Ökelnaams.<br />"
"Normalerwies warrt en Persoon ehr Status mit en Lüttbild wiest, man as't lett hest Du keen Lüttbild-Mustern installeert. Kiek Di maal de Instellen an: <i>Konversation instellen</i>, <i>Instellen</i>, <i>Utsehn</i>, <i>Mustern</i>.</p>"
"</qt>"

#. +> trunk
#: src/irc/nicklistview.cpp:264
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p>This shows all the people in the channel.  The nick for each person is shown, with a picture showing their status.</p>"
"<table>"
"<tr>"
"<th><img src=\"admin\"/></th>"
"<td>This person has administrator privileges.</td>"
"</tr>"
"<tr>"
"<th><img src=\"owner\"/></th>"
"<td>This person is a channel owner.</td>"
"</tr>"
"<tr>"
"<th><img src=\"op\"/></th>"
"<td>This person is a channel operator.</td>"
"</tr>"
"<tr>"
"<th><img src=\"halfop\"/></th>"
"<td>This person is a channel half-operator.</td>"
"</tr>"
"<tr>"
"<th><img src=\"voice\"/></th>"
"<td>This person has voice, and can therefore talk in a moderated channel.</td>"
"</tr>"
"<tr>"
"<th><img src=\"normal\"/></th>"
"<td>This person does not have any special privileges.</td>"
"</tr>"
"<tr>"
"<th><img src=\"normalaway\"/></th>"
"<td>This indicates that this person is currently away.</td>"
"</tr>"
"</table>"
"<p>The meaning of admin, owner and halfop varies between different IRC servers.</p>"
"<p>Hovering over any nick shows their current status. See the Konversation Handbook for more information.</p>"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Dit wiest all Lüü binnen den Klöönruum. Wiest warrt de Ökelnaam un en Lüttbild för den Status.</p>"
"<table>"
"<tr>"
"<th><img src=\"admin\"/></th>"
"<td>Disse Persoon hett Pleger-Verlöven.</td>"
"</tr>"
"<tr>"
"<th><img src=\"owner\"/></th>"
"<td>Disse Persoon is en Klöönruum-Eegner.</td>"
"</tr>"
"<tr>"
"<th><img src=\"op\"/></th>"
"<td>Disse Persoon is en Klöönruum-Baas.</td>"
"</tr>"
"<tr>"
"<th><img src=\"halfop\"/></th>"
"<td>Disse Persoon is en Klööruum-Halfbaas.</td>"
"</tr>"
"<tr>"
"<th><img src=\"voice\"/></th>"
"<td>Disse Persoon hett Stimm, un kann binnen modereert Klöönrüüm snacken.</td>"
"</tr>"
"<tr>"
"<th><img src=\"normal\"/></th>"
"<td>Disse Persoon het keen besünner Verlöven.</td>"
"</tr>"
"<tr>"
"<th><img src=\"normalaway\"/></th>"
"<td>Dit wiest, dat disse Persoon opstunns weg is.</td>"
"</tr>"
"</table>"
"<p>De Utdrück \"Pleger\", \"Eegner\" un \"Halfbaas\" hebbt op de verscheden IRC-Servers deelwies anner Bedüden.</p>"
"<p>Dör Anrögen vun en Ökelnaam mit de Muus warrt de tohören Status wiest. In't Konversation-Handbook laat sik man noch mehr Införmatschonen finnen.</p>"
"</qt>"

